sequenceDiagram
  actor H as Human
  participant P as Planner (plan mode)
  participant X as Executor
  participant T as Tests / pnpm check
  H->>P: docs/specs/0002-*.md
  P->>P: read code, AGENTS.md (no edits)
  P-->>H: questions + task table (docs/tasks/0002-*.md)
  H->>P: answers, approve plan
  loop each task T1..Tn
    H->>X: "do T2, check: pnpm vitest run test/daily-stats.test.ts"
    X->>T: write failing test, then code
    T-->>X: red / green
    X-->>H: done + verified (command, output)
  end
  H->>T: pnpm check
